---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Disclaimer | GlobalsBlog"
	description="Read the GlobalsBlog disclaimer regarding informational content, accuracy, and external links."
>
	<section class="content-page">
		<div class="content-hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">Disclaimer</p>
			<h1>Important notes about the content published on GlobalsBlog.</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				All information on GlobalsBlog is published in good faith for general informational
				purposes. While we aim to keep articles useful and accurate, we do not make guarantees
				about completeness, reliability, or suitability for every situation.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="content-grid">
			<article class="content-card">
				<h2>Editorial information</h2>
				<p>
					Content across travel, beauty, auto, and news categories is intended to inform readers
					and should not be treated as professional legal, financial, medical, or technical
					advice unless explicitly stated.
				</p>

				<h2>Accuracy and updates</h2>
				<p>
					Articles may be updated, corrected, or expanded over time. Information can change, and
					some posts may become outdated after publication.
				</p>

				<h2>Affiliate, sponsored, or ad-supported content</h2>
				<p>
					GlobalsBlog may display advertising or publish sponsored or commercial content in the
					future. Where appropriate, such relationships should be disclosed according to the
					site’s publishing practices.
				</p>
			</article>

			<aside class="content-card content-card-accent">
				<h2>External websites</h2>
				<p>
					If you follow a link from GlobalsBlog to another website, you do so at your own
					discretion. We are not responsible for the availability, accuracy, or policies of
					external websites.
				</p>

				<h2>Contact for concerns</h2>
				<p>
					If you have concerns about any page or article, contact
					<a href="mailto:contact@globalsblog.com">contact@globalsblog.com</a>.
				</p>
			</aside>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
